# Cloudflare Pages and Netlify both read this file, in this same format.
# Inert on hosts that don't, which costs nothing but does not travel either.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Every media file is listed by name on purpose. These used to live under
# assets/ and one wildcard covered them, but uploading through a browser
# flattens folders and kept breaking every assets/ path in the CSS. The site
# is flat now, so a wildcard here would also catch index.html and freeze the
# menu prices behind a year-long cache. Explicit names are the safe version.
#
# Replacing an image under the same filename won't reach repeat visitors for a
# year. Change the filename too when you swap a photo.

